    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br>Welcome to “TennesSEAn”! This stylish designer-furnished home is just a 4-minute walk from Sugar White Sand, offering the perfect Inlet Beach escape. Enjoy peaceful, uncrowded beaches with easy access to Rosemary Alys and 30Avenue for dining and shopping.<br><br>Each guest is provided with beach essentials, including eight chairs, two umbrellas, twelve beach towels, and a backpack cooler.<br><br>Relax, explore, and soak up the sun. Book your getaway today!<br>The space<br>Discover your dream 30A vacation in this luxury Inlet Beach home, just a short walk to the Gulf and minutes from Rosemary Beach, Seacrest, and Alys Beach. Perfect for families and groups, this 5-bedroom, 4.5-bath retreat offers just shy of 2,900 sq. ft. of stylish living space.<br><br>The first floor features an open layout with a spacious living room, dining area, gourmet kitchen with high-end appliances, and a king primary suite with a spa-like en suite bath. On the second floor, you’ll find three comfortable bedrooms, two full baths, a laundry room, and a large balcony—ideal for morning coffee or evening cocktails. The third floor includes a private suite with twin beds, its own bathroom, and a private balcony for relaxing after a day on 30A.<br><br>Luxury linens, plush towels, and thoughtful amenities ensure a comfortable stay. Guests love the easy 4-minute walk to the beach access, or a quick bike ride to the shops, dining, and nightlife of Rosemary Beach, Seacrest, and Alys Beach. Panama City Beach is just a short drive away for even more fun.<br><br>Whether you’re here for a family vacation, beach getaway, or group retreat, this 30A rental home is designed to make your stay unforgettable.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "New List 5BR/4.5 BA close to Rosemary Beach"
        }
      ],
